From 03023822abe64208c7cb8acbc202ccc51bedb9ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: klave7 <5594473+klave7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:11:43 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] In-game control editor

Press and hold the layout button (or turn on "Edit controls at start" on the
settings screen) to open an editor: drag each control, size it with a slider,
and switch it off or on. Positions and sizes are kept per game as offsets from
the built-in layout; which controls are on is kept per layout (2D, 3D), so the
D-pad, L3 and R3 can be shown in 2D and the stick hidden. Off controls take no
touches. New launcher setting DM_PAD_EDIT (iOS only); docs and the settings
test updated.

Compile-checked for the iPhone SDK; not yet run on a device.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
